## Welcome to your SimpleWiki! 🎉

Your new, simple wiki.

## What You Can Do Here

## 👈 Read the user manual!

⚠️ Optimal usability when used with MultiWikiServer-wikiwise!
Without MWS-wikiwise, you'll have to save changes manually! To do so, click ⚙️ -> “Save as File” and overwrite the existing file!

* [[🇩🇪 Inhaltsübersicht]]
* [[🇺🇸 Overview]]

Also:

* **Create pages** – via the menu ☰ or “+ New Page”
* **Writing** – Markdown is supported
* **Linking** – [[Page Name]] in the text or the 🔗 button while editing
* **Copying** – the ⧉ button creates a copy of the page
* **Search** – at the top of the page
* **Select language** – top right
* **Light / Dark** – the sun and the moon
* **Set Options** \- ⚙️

**Have fun!** ✍️